# @agent-k/host

You are in the **extension host** domain (Node + `vscode` API, esbuild bundle).

## Allowed
- `ChatViewProvider`, session/plan/debug host bridges, runtime singletons
- `postMessage` handlers and host-side orchestration
- Activation wiring in `src/extension.ts`

## Forbidden without an explicit cross-cutting task
- Rewriting React UI under `src/chat/components/**` or chat CSS
- Vite webview build config unless activation/HTML loading requires it
- Provider HTTP client internals (prefer `src/providers` / `packages/providers`)

## Boundary notes
- Live chat provider is `src/host/ChatViewProvider.ts` (not the dead duplicate under `src/chat/`).
- Prefer calling core/tools/providers packages over importing chat UI helpers; if a helper is shared, move it out of chat first.
